    "acceptanceCriteria": [
      {
        "id": "AC-1",
        "text": "`README.md` exists at the repository root and a docs test finds in it the ten module coordinates `com.snoworca.naruserve:<artifactId>:0.9.0` (the lowercase artifactIds of FR-REL-005 for the nine JAR modules and `NaruServe-android`) equal to the rows of the module table of `docs/api/README.md`, the text `publishToMavenLocal`, the text `mavenLocal()` and the `implementation 'com.snoworca.naruserve:naruserve:0.9.0'` line. [D-379; wave decision Publishing; android-module decision 2026-10-26; central-0.9.0 decision 2026-10-27]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 629
      },
      {
        "id": "AC-2",
        "text": "The ```java and ```kotlin quick-start blocks of `README.md` are character-for-character equal to the Java and Kotlin blocks under \"5분 시작\" of `docs/api/README.md`, which a docs test asserts; the Java block of `docs/api/README.md` stays on the named skip list of `DocsExamplesCompileTest` with the reason `app-defined type `User``, and the root `README.md` is not compiled. [D-379; I-009]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 630
      },
      {
        "id": "AC-3",
        "text": "`README.md` states that the Android sample build and API 21 device or emulator verification are not part of v1 and that API 21 compatibility rests on `--release 8` and the animal-sniffer `android-api-level-21` check, and links `docs/api/README.md`, `docs/release/release-notes.md`, `docs/release/test-results.md` and `THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md`, all of which exist. [r1 W1-005; D-379]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 631
      },
      {
        "id": "AC-4",
        "text": "`README.md` holds no (미확정) marker and names the TinyHttpd instruction of OPS-REL-005. [D-379; D-380; D-383]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 632
      },
      {
        "id": "AC-5",
        "text": "The Install section of `README.md` shows a `repositories` block with `mavenCentral()` and without `mavenLocal()` before the `implementation 'com.snoworca.naruserve:naruserve:0.9.0'` line and states that the modules are published on Maven Central; `publishToMavenLocal` and `mavenLocal()` appear only under a source-checkout heading; and neither `README.md` nor `docs/api/README.md` contains \"published to the local Maven repository only\" or \"not published to Maven Central\", which a docs test asserts. [central-0.9.0 publication 2026-10-27]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 633
      }
    ],
